    cml:logicSummary "The performance of hard labour in pursuance of a sentence to such punishment by a competent court is permitted." ;
    cml:premiseText "Paragraph 3(a) shall not be held to preclude, in countries where imprisonment with hard labour may be imposed as a punishment for a crime," ;
